脑子里什么也不想的时候

32
00:02:00,140 --> 00:02:04,440
All right. Very impressive, Anthony.
行了 非常令人印象深刻 安东尼

33
00:02:04,440 --> 00:02:07,270
You know what?
Only my mother calls me Anthony.
你知道吗 只有我妈才叫我安东尼

34
00:02:07,900 --> 00:02:08,900
Tony.
叫我托尼

35
00:02:10,820 --> 00:02:12,820
Okay, then. Tony.
好吧 托尼

36
00:02:13,780 --> 00:02:15,700
You'll be hearing from us soon.
我们很快就会联系你

37
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:19,490
And then they just sat there
and stared at me.
然后他们就坐在那儿盯着我看

38
00:02:19,490 --> 00:02:20,750
- -I'm telling you,
-

39
00:02:20,750 --> 00:02:24,370
these people are so fucking stupid it's insane.
-我跟你说 这些人蠢得要死 简直疯了

40
00:02:24,370 --> 00:02:25,710
I said I was gonna write the whole thing
我说我要把整本书

41
00:02:25,710 --> 00:02:28,460
on one piece of paper, and they believed me.
写在一张纸上 他们居然信了

42
00:02:29,380 --> 00:02:30,670
They were... They were just nodding,
他们当时...

43
00:02:30,670 --> 00:02:32,510
like I was explaining the rules of a brothel.
他们就只是点头
就像我在解释妓院的规矩一样

44
00:02:33,590 --> 00:02:35,340
EI already found this Upper West Side place,
而且我已经在上西区找好地方了

45
00:02:35,340 --> 00:02:37,010
right where Salinger grew up.
就在塞林格长大的地方附近

46
00:02:37,010 --> 00:02:38,470
It's fucking perfect.
简直完美

47
00:02:38,470 --> 00:02:39,640
Just gotta tell my parents
我只要告诉父母

48
00:02:39,640 --> 00:02:41,020
that the fellowship takes place in New York,
这个写作津贴项目在纽约

49
00:02:41,020 --> 00:02:42,140
and I'm outta here.
然后我就闪人了

50
00:02:43,730 --> 00:02:45,940
Okay, but you gotta write a book?
好吧 但你得写本书啊

51
00:02:45,940 --> 00:02:48,980
Yeah, but that's what I've
been trying to do all year.
对啊 但这正是我
一整年都在努力想做的事

52
00:02:48,980 --> 00:02:52,190
I swear, it's like God is
finally starting to notice me.
我发誓 感觉上帝终于开始注意到我了

53
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:55,490
Word for that is "providence."
这叫“天意”

54
00:02:55,490 --> 00:02:57,660
The word... The word for what?
这个词...什么词

55
00:02:59,330 --> 00:03:01,370
It's when God fi...
就是上帝...

